msgid "Ryuuji「......Even I think my face is kind of＿reptilian, but it hurts to hear it flat＿out......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Hasta yo creo que mi cara es＿algo reptiliana, pero duele que me＿lo digan tan directo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Aww, Inko-chan is in a total panic......＿This is no good.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ay, Inko-chan entró en pánico＿total...... Esto no pinta bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hmm? What about help......? Wait, I get＿it. I only pretended to space out,＿Inko-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mmm? ¿Qué pasa con la ayuda......?＿Ah, ya entiendo. Solo fingí estar＿distraído, Inko-chan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, you don't like being given that＿look? Why's that, Inko-chan?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué, no te gusta que te miren así?＿¿Por qué será, Inko-chan?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What's wrong, Inko-chan......? Oh, no＿one's going to cook or eat you,＿Inko-chan......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué pasa, Inko-chan......?＿Ah, nadie va a cocinarte ni a＿comerte, Inko-chan......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Aww crap, it's completely panicking.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Rayos, entró en pánico por completo.」"
